    "text": "Trump strikes deal with India making U.S. primary supplier or partner for multiple products\nFeb. 13, 2025: 6:20 p.m.:\nTrump strikes deal with India making U.S. primary supplier or partner for multiple products\nEnergy / oil and gas, U.S. nuclear technology, AI and other advanced technologies will be developed in partnership with each other.\nPresident Trump: “India is also reforming its laws to welcome US nuclear technology into the Indian market. This will bring safe, clean, and affordable electricity to millions and billions of dollars to the U.S. civilian nuclear industry in India.”\npic.twitter.com/tO69JRgg4K\n— Benny Johnson (@bennyjohnson) February 13, 2025\nWND Staff Elizabeth has been a freelance content writer for over 20 years and has enjoyed having her prose published in both the non-fiction and fiction markets. She has written a variety of different types of content, including Christian articles, healthy lifestyle, blog posts, business topics, news articles, product descriptions, and some fiction. She is also a singer-songwriter-musician. When she's not busy with writing or music, she enjoys spending time with friends or family and doing fun social activities such as hiking, swing dancing, attending concerts and other enjoyable activities. Read more of WND Staff's articles here.\nTrump Chronicles Show Full Content",
